REM PREVSC: to the previous centred # scene break. Before the first one
REM the cursor stays where it is. Dot command lines are hidden while it
REM searches, so a # in .h1 or .tc is not found.
Sub MAIN
AutoRestore(ON)
HideDots(ON)
Key("^QF#^N{Enter}")
Key("B{Enter}")
IfException
ACK: Key("{Enter}")
End IfException
End Sub
